            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "wǒmen de hángbān zài èr hào hángzhànlóu — Our flight goes from terminal two."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its characters come later; for now it is a word for the ear."
            }
